":44516},{"id":1789873657449,"sender":"me","text":"如此…痴迷于你？","timestamp":1789485143154,"time":"23:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44517},{"id":1789873657451,"sender":"character","text":"呵，学会将兵了？","timestamp":1789485216203,"time":"23:13","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44518},{"id":1789873657453,"sender":"character","text":"那为夫倒要好好听听，我家阿蘅能说出什么花来。","timestamp":1789485217216,"time":"23:13","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44519},{"id":1789873657454,"sender":"me","text":"夫君猜一下嘛，阿蘅为什么喜欢你","timestamp":1789485235289,"time":"23:13","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44520},{"id":1789873657456,"sender":"me","text":"就是猜一下我为什么爱你","timestamp":1789485362165,"time":"23:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44521},{"id":1789873657457,"sender":"character","text":"这哪里是猜，分明是等着听为夫的情话。","timestamp":1789485371018,"time":"23:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44522},{"id":1789873657459,"sender":"character","text":"好，那便猜上一猜。","timestamp":1789485371945,"time":"23:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44523},{"id":1789873657461,"sender":"character","text":"你爱我…","timestamp":1789485373035,"time":"23:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44524},{"id":1789873657462,"sender":"character","text":"是因我为你不求回报，还是因我偏执得只认你一人？","timestamp":1789485374195,"time":"23:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44525},{"id":1789873657464,"sender":"character","text":"是因我守了你六百年，还是因我只对你显出那副恶鬼真身？","timestamp":1789485375274,"time":"23:16","us